  {
   "id": "note",
   "type": "Note",
   "params": {
    "text": "Live booleans, in glass\n\nThe textbook CSG tree: (Box ∩ Sphere) − three crossed Cylinders, drawn as glass around an emissive core.\n\nTurn on Live, then drag 1 · Sfera or 2 · Fori — or press the ▶ on the slider to sweep it. While the value moves, the Intersect / Union / Subtract chain is redone IN THE BROWSER on meshes (manifold-wasm): no run, no round trip. The exact build123d result lands once, when you let go.\n\nWhat can be anticipated: Box, Cylinder, Sphere, Move, Rotate, Union, Subtract, Intersect and value nodes wired into them. Anything else just falls back to a normal re-run."
   },
